<wait 1000>
ls<wait 900><Enter><wait 1800>
n := int(`grep -c ERROR app.log`)<wait 700><Enter><wait 600>
writeln('errors: ', n, ', doubled: ', n * 2)<wait 700><Enter><wait 2000>
for f in glob('*.log') do<wait 500><Enter><wait 400>
writeln(f, ': ', int(`grep -c ERROR $f`))<wait 500><Enter><wait 400><Enter><wait 2200>
ehco hi<wait 700><Enter><wait 2000>
<Right><wait 900><Enter><wait 1800>
cat no<wait 400><Tab><wait 900><Tab><wait 1800>
t<wait 500><Tab><wait 900><Enter><wait 2200>
exit<wait 400><Enter>
